      "barrier": "Original interaction may be interpreted as behaviour rather than communication, and twelve messages on one screen are too dense for a gaze or switch user.",
      "support": "Provide direct messages for break, privacy, disagreement, help, wait, different, and finished across two gaze-safe pages with Help on each."
    }
